WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:18.879
The horse sleeps in the stable.

2
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:31.084
The pig sleeps in the pen.

3
00:00:31.085 --> 00:00:39.226
The squirrel sleeps in the tree hole.

4
00:00:39.227 --> 00:00:49.401
The parrot sleeps in the cage.

5
00:00:49.402 --> 00:00:59.539
The cat sleeps in the basket.

6
00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:09.736
The goldfish sleeps in the fishbowl.

7
00:01:09.737 --> 00:01:19.879
The moon sleeps in the sky.

8
00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:33.542
Where do you sleep?

9
00:01:33.543 --> 00:01:44.945
I sleep in my bed.
